      "id": 1,
      "text": "Sunday Rock, a 64,000‑pound glacial boulder, sits in Colton and was added to the National Register of Historic Places in 2009.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        6,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
